      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p01.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7209
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "Gran is up the road with no hot food. So Lan will float the tin boat to her.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6765,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7340
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "Lan tugs on her red coat and loads the boat: oats, a loaf and soap.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6034,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6974
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "A fat toad hops in and sits on the loaf. \"That is Gran's loaf, toad!\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6765,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8045
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Lan pushes off with a long oak stick. The boat floats. The toad floats too!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6452,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "It is dark. The moon sits on the road, white as soap. Lan aims the boat at it.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7941,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8986
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "The moon slips off. Lan leans out, the boat tips, and her coat is soaked. Lan groans.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8724,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8646
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Gran opens the door and grins at the soaked coat. She makes hot toast and roasts the oats.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7575,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8045
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "\"Did that toad help?\" Gran asks. The toad has no answer: it sits in the boat and croaks.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_065/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7836,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_065/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8829
    },
    {
